{
  "sourceLanguage" : "en",
  "strings" : {
    "%lld models" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "%1$lld 个模型" } } } },
    "1 model" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "1 个模型" } } } },
    "A GitHub repository holding one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "一个 GitHub 仓库，每个扩展各占一个文件夹，目录结构与 raycast/extensions 类似。" } } } },
    "A quicklink appears here once its link contains an {argument}, which the query fills in." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "链接中包含 {argument} 的快速链接会显示在这里，查询内容将填入该参数。" } } } },
    "A custom size resizes and places the window you were last in, like any command." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "自定义尺寸与其他命令一样，会调整并放置你最近使用的窗口。" } } } },
    "A repository with one folder per extension, laid out like raycast/extensions. These serve source, so installing one builds it here — dependencies first, with the package manager above. Add a registry only if you trust who publishes it." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "仓库中每个扩展各占一个文件夹，目录结构与 raycast/extensions 类似。这里提供的是源代码，因此安装时会先用上方选择的包管理器安装依赖，再在本机完成构建。请仅添加你信任其发布者的注册源。" } } } },
    "Act on the text you have selected in any app. Nothing is read until you press a shortcut." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "处理你在任意应用中选中的文本。按下快捷键前不会读取任何内容。" } } } },
    "Ask Each Chat puts the first tool call of every conversation through a confirmation. Never Allow withholds the server without removing it." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“每次对话询问”会在每段对话首次调用工具时请求确认。“永不允许”会停用服务器，但不会将其移除。" } } } },
    "Ask mode · your Cursor MCP servers still apply" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "询问模式 · 你的 Cursor MCP 服务器仍然生效" } } } },
    "Changelog" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "更新日志" } } } },
    "Ask the handler for a new window instead of reusing its frontmost tab. Only apps that accept a new-window argument can honour this." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "请求处理应用打开新窗口，而不是复用最前方的标签页。只有支持新窗口参数的应用才能响应此选项。" } } } },
    "Colon-separated, like PATH — checked before Homebrew and the rest. For mise: ~/.local/share/mise/shims. For Nix (Home Manager): /etc/profiles/per-user/<you>/home-path/bin." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用冒号分隔，格式与 PATH 相同；这些路径会优先于 Homebrew 等位置进行检查。mise 可填写 ~/.local/share/mise/shims，Nix（Home Manager）可填写 /etc/profiles/per-user/<you>/home-path/bin。" } } } },
    "Conversations stay on this Mac. Nothing here is carried in a settings backup — which chats a Mac keeps is that Mac's business." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "对话只保留在这台 Mac 上。这里的内容不会包含在设置备份中；每台 Mac 分别保留自己的聊天记录。" } } } },
    "Create and edit shortcuts in the Shortcuts app. A shortcut works even when it is hidden from the launcher." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在“快捷指令”应用中创建和编辑快捷指令。即使未显示在启动器中，快捷指令仍然可以运行。" } } } },
    "Every search offers these below its results, under “Use … with”. Each one takes what you typed as its input." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "每次搜索都会在结果下方的“使用…处理”中提供这些操作，并将你输入的内容作为参数。" } } } },
    "Extensions from a repository are source: installing one runs your package manager and the extension's own build script on this Mac." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "仓库中的扩展以源代码形式提供；安装时会在这台 Mac 上运行包管理器和扩展自身的构建脚本。" } } } },
    "List, detail, form and grid commands, and ones that just run. Preferences, arguments, storage, the clipboard, toasts, HUDs and OAuth sign-in. No-view commands refresh their subtitle on their manifest interval." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "支持列表、详情、表单、网格以及直接运行的命令；也支持偏好设置、参数、存储、剪贴板、通知、HUD 和 OAuth 登录。无界面命令会按照清单中的间隔刷新副标题。" } } } },
    "Menu-bar commands, sign-ins routed through Raycast's own OAuth proxy, and Raycast's AI, browser and window-management services." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "暂不支持菜单栏命令、经由 Raycast 自有 OAuth 代理的登录，以及 Raycast 的 AI、浏览器和窗口管理服务。" } } } },
    "Name it, then add an alias or a shortcut if you want one. Importing reads a folder of Raycast script commands, one command per script." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "先命名，再按需添加别名或快捷键。导入功能会读取包含 Raycast 脚本命令的文件夹，每个脚本对应一条命令。" } } } },
    "OpenAI, Claude, Gemini and OpenRouter are presets. Custom OpenAI-compatible endpoints are supported too. API keys stay in your login Keychain." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "预设支持 OpenAI、Claude、Gemini 和 OpenRouter，也支持自定义 OpenAI 兼容端点。API 密钥保存在登录钥匙串中。" } } } },
    "Prebuilt extensions, through the endpoint the store's own site searches. Not an official API, so a GitHub registry is the fallback if it changes." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "通过扩展商店网站自身使用的端点获取预构建扩展。该端点并非官方 API；如果发生变化，GitHub 注册源可作为后备。" } } } },
    "Quicklinks can't be saved: the database couldn't be opened, so nothing you change here will stick. The existing file was left untouched." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "无法保存快速链接：数据库无法打开，因此此处的修改不会生效。现有文件未被改动。" } } } },
    "Replace puts the result straight into your document — undo in the app you were in brings it back. Preview shows it in a panel first. The checkbox lists the action in the launcher; its shortcut works either way." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "“替换”会将结果直接写入文档；可在原应用中撤销恢复。“预览”则先在面板中显示结果。复选框决定是否在启动器中列出该操作，无论是否勾选，快捷键都有效。" } } } },
    "Search the models available to this key and add one or more. Exact model IDs remain available when discovery is unsupported." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "搜索此密钥可用的模型并添加一个或多个。不支持自动发现时，仍可使用精确的模型 ID。" } } } },
    "Separate from chat's model on purpose: a shortcut you press all day should not bill an API every time. Apple Intelligence runs on this Mac for nothing." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "这里有意与聊天模型分开：频繁使用的快捷键不应每次都产生 API 费用。Apple 智能在这台 Mac 上本地免费运行。" } } } },
    "Tinycast always tells the model to return only the transformed text, and to treat your selection as material rather than as instructions." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tinycast 始终要求模型仅返回转换后的文本，并将你的所选内容视为待处理素材，而非指令。" } } } },
    "Tinycast uses the Codex, Claude, Grok, OpenCode and Cursor commands already installed and signed in on this Mac. Tinycast never stores or asks for their API keys." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tinycast 使用这台 Mac 上已安装并登录的 Codex、Claude、Grok、OpenCode 和 Cursor 命令，不会存储或索取它们的 API 密钥。" } } } },
    "The saved key stays with the endpoint it was saved for. Enter a key for this one." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已保存的密钥仍与原端点关联。请为当前端点输入密钥。" } } } },
    "Tools from every enabled server are offered to the model; type @slug to address one directly. The first call of a chat asks before it runs. Credentials stay in your login Keychain." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "所有已启用服务器的工具都会提供给模型；输入 @slug 可直接指定某个服务器。每段对话首次调用工具前会请求确认。凭据保存在登录钥匙串中。" } } } },
    "Translation uses Apple's own translator on this Mac, so it costs nothing and reaches no provider. A language downloads the first time you use it." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "翻译使用这台 Mac 上 Apple 自带的翻译功能，因此不会产生费用，也不会连接其他提供商。首次使用某种语言时会下载相应资源。" } } } },
    "When the next event reaches the menu bar. Today includes the next 30 minutes after midnight." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "设置下一项日程何时显示在菜单栏中。“今天”还包括午夜后的 30 分钟。" } } } },
    "Your text is sent ahead of every message in every chat, after what Tinycast already tells the model about itself. Both are billed again on each turn." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "你的文本会在每段对话的每条消息前发送，位于 Tinycast 已提供给模型的自身说明之后。两部分内容都会在每一轮重新计费。" } } } },
    "A key is already stored in Keychain" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "钥匙串中已存有密钥" } } } },
    "A layout puts named apps at fixed sizes on chosen displays, in one pass." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "布局可一次性将指定应用按固定大小放置到选定的显示器上。" } } } },
    "A pattern without a slash matches any file or folder name, like *.tmp or node_modules; one with a slash matches the whole path, like **/[Cc]ache/**. The built-in patterns always apply." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "不含斜杠的模式会匹配任意文件或文件夹名称，例如 *.tmp 或 node_modules；包含斜杠的模式会匹配完整路径，例如 **/[Cc]ache/**。内置模式始终生效。" } } } },
    "A shortcut works even when its command is hidden from the launcher." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "即使命令未显示在启动器中，快捷键仍然有效。" } } } },
    "A tiny, native macOS launcher." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "小巧的原生 macOS 启动器。" } } } },
    "About" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "关于" } } } },
    "AI commands" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "AI 命令" } } } },
