    "Tinycast privately learns which results you choose for each query. Reset all learned choices to restore the default order." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tinycast 会在本地学习你为每次查询选择的结果。重置所有学习记录可恢复默认顺序。" } } } },
    "Tinycast sends your selected text to the model with these instructions." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tinycast 会将所选文本和这些指令一起发送给模型。" } } } },
    "Tinycast will relearn your preferred results as you use the launcher." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "Tinycast 会在你使用启动器时重新学习偏好的结果。" } } } },
