    "Used by Tinycast features unless they ask you to choose another model." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "供 Tinycast 各功能使用，除非功能要求选择其他模型。" } } } },
    "Used by every action without a model of its own, except Translate." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "供所有未单独指定模型的操作使用，但“翻译”除外。" } } } },
