    "What ↵ does on an entry; ⌘↵ does the other one." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "在条目上按 ↵ 执行的操作；⌘↵ 执行另一项。" } } } },
    "When there's no selected text" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "没有所选文本时" } } } },
    "Where Tinycast looks when you search for an extension to install." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "搜索可安装扩展时 Tinycast 查询的位置。" } } } },
    "Window Layouts" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "窗口布局" } } } },
    "Window Management" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "窗口管理" } } } },
    "Window commands" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "窗口命令" } } } },
    "Write your whole library to a JSON file." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "将整个资料库写入 JSON 文件。" } } } },
    "Your home folder expands to its visible folders and cloud drives, never to its Library. An empty list searches nothing." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "个人文件夹会展开到可见文件夹和云盘，但不会展开到资源库。列表为空时不搜索任何位置。" } } } },
    "Allow Calendar Access…" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "允许访问日历…" } } } },
    "Already installed. Reinstalling replaces it with the registry's copy." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已安装。重新安装会将其替换为注册源中的版本。" } } } },
    "An extension that needs something missing says so when you run it." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "扩展缺少所需能力时，会在运行时提示。" } } } },
