    "Entry being edited" : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "正在编辑的条目" } } } },
    "Give the snippet a searchable name and an optional expansion keyword." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "为片段设置可搜索的名称和可选的展开关键词。" } } } },
    "Go back to the icon the extension ships." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "恢复扩展自带的图标。" } } } },
    "Images pasted into the chat go to any model that accepts them; others never see one." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "粘贴到聊天中的图像只会发送给支持图像的模型，其他模型不会收到。" } } } },
    "Its global shortcut and launcher references go with it." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "其全局快捷键和启动器引用也会一并删除。" } } } },
    "Its global shortcut and launcher references will also be removed." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "其全局快捷键和启动器引用也会被移除。" } } } },
    "Its own menu bar item, showing a meeting icon or its title and countdown." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "使用独立菜单栏项目，显示会议图标或标题及倒计时。" } } } },
    "Its saved API key will also be deleted from Keychain." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "已保存的 API 密钥也会从钥匙串中删除。" } } } },
    "Its tools stop being offered, and its stored credentials are deleted." : { "localizations" : { "zh-Hans" : { "stringUnit" : { "state" : "translated", "value" : "其工具将不再可用，保存的凭据也会被删除。" } } } },
